   809	### 8.1 Cache identity
   810	
   811	The logical cache key is computed exactly as in `protocol/core.md` sections 9.1
   812	and 9.2, over the canonical hardened build input of section 2.2 — the portable
   813	input with the hardened `execution_policy` value and the closed `hardened`
   814	member carrying the profile identity and the `curator-hardened-tcb-v1` digest.
   815	
